{"parse":{"title":"极心测试充值返还规则说明","pageid":3159,"revid":6711,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A\" title=\"公告\">公告</a> &gt; <b>极心测试充值返还规则说明</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E6.9E.81.E5.BF.83.E6.B5.8B.E8.AF.95.E5.85.85.E5.80.BC.E8.BF.94.E8.BF.98.E8.A7.84.E5.88.99.E8.AF.B4.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"极心测试充值返还规则说明\">极心测试充值返还规则说明</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：极心测试充值返还规则说明\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-22 19:11<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FLyjiybjV5JJx84V0jHiyOA\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LyjiybjV5JJx84V0jHiyOA</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" /><br /><br />\n尊敬的团长：<br />\n本次<font color=\"brown\"><b>【铃兰之剑】付费删档测试</b></font>中，团长的累计充值金额将在<font color=\"brown\"><b>公测期以正式服资源</b></font>形式返还。以下为本次极心测试的<font color=\"brown\"><b>充值返还规则</b></font>：\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">账号要求</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>本次极心测试入口<font color=\"brown\"><b>仅在TapTap安卓端</b></font>开放，团长仅可以通过安卓客户端进行充值。<br />\n请团长保持本次<font color=\"brown\"><b>极心测试账号</b></font>与<font color=\"brown\"><b>公测期正式服登录账号</b></font>相同，即可顺利获得充值返还。<br />\n公测期正式服中<font color=\"brown\"><b>多端数据共通</b></font>。所以团长在公测后使用<font color=\"brown\"><b>任意客户端</b></font>登录本次极心测试使用的TapTap账号，均可以在游戏内收到<font color=\"brown\"><b>充值返还邮件</b></font>。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>举例：</b><br />\n本次团长参与极心测试在安卓端登录的是<font color=\"brown\"><b>A账号</b></font>，并且进行了充值。那么需要在<font color=\"brown\"><b>公测</b></font>时候同样登录<font color=\"brown\"><b>A账号</b></font>，不论是使用<font color=\"brown\"><b>安卓端</b></font>登录，还是<font color=\"brown\"><b>iOS端</b></font>登录都可以收到充值返还邮件。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">充返档位</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>本次极心测试中，团长<font color=\"brown\"><b>充值的总金额</b></font>将在公测期间按照<font color=\"brown\"><b>一定比例</b></font>以<font color=\"brown\"><b>希望晶石</b></font>的形式进行返还。<br />\n具体返还规则如下:<br />\n• 累计<font color=\"brown\"><b>充值1～2000RMB</b></font>：按金额<font color=\"brown\"><b>1:20</b></font>返还希望晶石（200%返利）<br />\n• 累计<font color=\"brown\"><b>充值超过2000RMB部分</b></font> ：按照金额<font color=\"brown\"><b>1:13</b></font>返还希望晶石（130%返利）<br />\n• 充值任意金额即可获得游戏内<font color=\"brown\"><b>【先遣者纪念雕像】</b></font><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>举例：</b><br />\n如果您在极心测试期间充值了1000RMB （仅包含购买干涉之力，希望的祝福），游戏正式上线后游戏内将进行<font color=\"brown\"><b>200%</b></font>的返还，即返还您20000希望晶石+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br /><br />\n如果您在极心测试期间充值了2001RMB （仅包含购买干涉之力，希望的祝福），游戏正式上线后游戏内将返还40000希望晶石（<font color=\"brown\"><b>200%</b></font>返利部分）+13希望晶石（<font color=\"brown\"><b>130%</b></font>返利部分）+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">希望的祝福</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p><font color=\"brown\"><b>「希望的祝福」</b></font>权益介绍：<font color=\"brown\"><b>每日签到</b></font>获取<font color=\"brown\"><b>希望晶石</b></font>*80，持续30日；<font color=\"brown\"><b>战斗回溯</b></font>次数+9特权，持续30日。<br />\n本次极心测试中，团长<font color=\"brown\"><b>限定只能购买一次</b></font>希望的祝福，在公测期，同一账号将直接获得一张全新未使用的<font color=\"brown\"><b>「希望的祝福」+【先遣者纪念雕像】</b></font>。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>举例：</b><br />\n如果您在极心测试期间购买了一次「希望的祝福」，购买金额计入充值总额中，并在正式上线后将会获得一张<font color=\"brown\"><b>全新未使用</b></font>的「希望的祝福」。'<br />\n全新未使用的「希望的祝福」将通过<font color=\"brown\"><b>邮件</b></font>发放，从领取之日开始计算<font color=\"brown\"><b>30天</b></font>权益，邮件将在创角<font color=\"brown\"><b>90天</b></font>后过期失效，请团长及时领取。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">综合举例</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>如果<font color=\"brown\"><b>付费测期间</b></font>，购买了：<br />\n• 1张月卡（30RMB）<br />\n• 外加5次648档位（3240RMB）\n<br /><br />\n则<font color=\"brown\"><b>公测</b></font>时，可获得：<br />\n• 1张月卡福利：30天月卡有效期<br />\n• 2000RMB内的双倍返利：40000希望晶石<br />\n• 2000RMB以上部分的1.3倍返利：（3270-2000）*13 = 16510希望晶石\n<br /><br />\n共计：56510希望晶石+30天月卡有效期+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">充返相关</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>1.充值返利跟随游戏账号，多端互通，将以游戏内邮件的形式进行发放。团长公测期间使用相同账号登录任意终端，开放邮件功能后，即可收到返利邮件。<br />*注意：返利邮件将在创角90天后过期，请团长及时登录领取。\n<br /><br />\n2.如对充返规则仍有疑问，可在游戏内联系客服进行了解咨询\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 206/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2263/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.937      1 -total\n 52.15%   16.134      1 模板:文章戳\n 47.52%   14.702      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3159-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163731 and revision id 6711. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"公告"}],"images":["官方消息192.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"极心测试充值返还规则说明","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"极心测试充值返还规则说明","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"极心测试充值返还规则说明"}],"displaytitle":"极心测试充值返还规则说明","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|公告}}\n=极心测试充值返还规则说明=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=公告\n|时间=2023-09-22 19:11\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LyjiybjV5JJx84V0jHiyOA\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息192.png|560px|link=]]<br><br>\n尊敬的团长：<br>\n本次<font color=brown>'''【铃兰之剑】付费删档测试'''</font>中，团长的累计充值金额将在<font color=brown>'''公测期以正式服资源'''</font>形式返还。以下为本次极心测试的<font color=brown>'''充值返还规则'''</font>：\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">账号要求</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n本次极心测试入口<font color=brown>'''仅在TapTap安卓端'''</font>开放，团长仅可以通过安卓客户端进行充值。<br>\n请团长保持本次<font color=brown>'''极心测试账号'''</font>与<font color=brown>'''公测期正式服登录账号'''</font>相同，即可顺利获得充值返还。<br>\n公测期正式服中<font color=brown>'''多端数据共通'''</font>。所以团长在公测后使用<font color=brown>'''任意客户端'''</font>登录本次极心测试使用的TapTap账号，均可以在游戏内收到<font color=brown>'''充值返还邮件'''</font>。<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''举例：'''<br>\n本次团长参与极心测试在安卓端登录的是<font color=brown>'''A账号'''</font>，并且进行了充值。那么需要在<font color=brown>'''公测'''</font>时候同样登录<font color=brown>'''A账号'''</font>，不论是使用<font color=brown>'''安卓端'''</font>登录，还是<font color=brown>'''iOS端'''</font>登录都可以收到充值返还邮件。\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">充返档位</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n本次极心测试中，团长<font color=brown>'''充值的总金额'''</font>将在公测期间按照<font color=brown>'''一定比例'''</font>以<font color=brown>'''希望晶石'''</font>的形式进行返还。<br>\n具体返还规则如下:<br>\n• 累计<font color=brown>'''充值1～2000RMB'''</font>：按金额<font color=brown>'''1:20'''</font>返还希望晶石（200%返利）<br>\n• 累计<font color=brown>'''充值超过2000RMB部分'''</font> ：按照金额<font color=brown>'''1:13'''</font>返还希望晶石（130%返利）<br>\n• 充值任意金额即可获得游戏内<font color=brown>'''【先遣者纪念雕像】'''</font><br>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''举例：'''<br>\n如果您在极心测试期间充值了1000RMB （仅包含购买干涉之力，希望的祝福），游戏正式上线后游戏内将进行<font color=brown>'''200%'''</font>的返还，即返还您20000希望晶石+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br><br>\n如果您在极心测试期间充值了2001RMB （仅包含购买干涉之力，希望的祝福），游戏正式上线后游戏内将返还40000希望晶石（<font color=brown>'''200%'''</font>返利部分）+13希望晶石（<font color=brown>'''130%'''</font>返利部分）+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">希望的祝福</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<font color=brown>'''「希望的祝福」'''</font>权益介绍：<font color=brown>'''每日签到'''</font>获取<font color=brown>'''希望晶石'''</font>*80，持续30日；<font color=brown>'''战斗回溯'''</font>次数+9特权，持续30日。<br>\n本次极心测试中，团长<font color=brown>'''限定只能购买一次'''</font>希望的祝福，在公测期，同一账号将直接获得一张全新未使用的<font color=brown>'''「希望的祝福」+【先遣者纪念雕像】'''</font>。<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''举例：'''<br>\n如果您在极心测试期间购买了一次「希望的祝福」，购买金额计入充值总额中，并在正式上线后将会获得一张<font color=brown>'''全新未使用'''</font>的「希望的祝福」。'<br>\n全新未使用的「希望的祝福」将通过<font color=brown>'''邮件'''</font>发放，从领取之日开始计算<font color=brown>'''30天'''</font>权益，邮件将在创角<font color=brown>'''90天'''</font>后过期失效，请团长及时领取。\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">综合举例</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n如果<font color=brown>'''付费测期间'''</font>，购买了：<br>\n• 1张月卡（30RMB）<br>\n• 外加5次648档位（3240RMB）\n<br><br>\n则<font color=brown>'''公测'''</font>时，可获得：<br>\n• 1张月卡福利：30天月卡有效期<br>\n• 2000RMB内的双倍返利：40000希望晶石<br>\n• 2000RMB以上部分的1.3倍返利：（3270-2000）*13 = 16510希望晶石\n<br><br>\n共计：56510希望晶石+30天月卡有效期+【先遣者纪念雕像】\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">充返相关</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n1.充值返利跟随游戏账号，多端互通，将以游戏内邮件的形式进行发放。团长公测期间使用相同账号登录任意终端，开放邮件功能后，即可收到返利邮件。<br>*注意：返利邮件将在创角90天后过期，请团长及时登录领取。\n<br><br>\n2.如对充返规则仍有疑问，可在游戏内联系客服进行了解咨询\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:32.327677+00:00"}